    UefiBootServicesTableLib
    UefiLib
    MemoryAllocationLib
    BaseMemoryLib
    BaseLib
    DevicePathLib
    DebugLib
    DxeServicesLib
    DxeServicesTableLib
    HobLib
    MemoryAllocationLib
    IoLib
    PerformanceLib
